          "description": "Kids - choose an instrument.  It's time to play your part in the Symphony of Cleanup!  Parents, sit back and enjoy the show as your little virtuosos make a masterpiece of your formerly cacophonous dining room.  But don't be surprised if you find yourself joining in as well!  Cleaning doesn't have to be a bore, and with this card it's certain to be a triumph!",
